{"id":"f1242eec9d0ed58f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/859_加法线性逻辑_ALL.md","title":"859 加法线性逻辑 ALL","display":"859_加法线性逻辑_ALL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lit}=\\{p^+:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\}\\cup\\{p^-:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Lit}=\\{p^+:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\}\\cup\\{p^-:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial(p^+)=p^-\">\\(\\partial(p^+)=p^-\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial(p^-)=p^+\">\\(\\partial(p^-)=p^+\\)</span>。ALL 的原始公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{with},\\operatorname{plus}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lit},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{with},\\operatorname{plus}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lit}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{with},\\operatorname{plus}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{with},\\operatorname{plus}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与对偶\">2. 公式与对偶</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lit}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lit}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{with}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{with}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对偶函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{lit}(\\partial(a)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{top}^\\perp=\\operatorname{zero},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{zero}^\\perp=\\operatorname{top},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lit}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{lit}(\\partial(a)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{top}^\\perp=\\operatorname{zero},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{zero}^\\perp=\\operatorname{top},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{with}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{plus}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{with}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{with}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{plus}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{with}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由原子、替换与-α-等价\">3. 自由原子、替换与 α 等价</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{base}(p^+)=p\">\\(\\operatorname{base}(p^+)=p\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{base}(p^-)=p\">\\(\\operatorname{base}(p^-)=p\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{lit}(a))=\\{\\operatorname{base}(a)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{lit}(a))=\\{\\operatorname{base}(a)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{top})\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{zero})\n=\n\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{top})\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{zero})\n=\n\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{with}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{plus}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{with}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{plus}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(p^+)=\\sigma(p)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(p^+)=\\sigma(p)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(p^-)=\\sigma(p)^\\perp\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(p^-)=\\sigma(p)^\\perp\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit}(a)[\\sigma]=\\widehat\\sigma(a),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{top}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{top},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{zero}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{zero},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lit}(a)[\\sigma]=\\widehat\\sigma(a),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{top}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{top},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{zero}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{zero},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{with}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{with}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{plus}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{with}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{with}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{plus}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(X)=p_m,\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:p_i\\notin X\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(X)=p_m,\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:p_i\\notin X\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\)</span>。对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{lit}(\\rho(p)^+).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{lit}(\\rho(p)^+).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-上下文与相继式\">4. 上下文与相继式</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\)</span> 上有限多重集集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta\\)</span> 为多重集和，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A=\\Gamma\\uplus\\mathbf 1_A\">\\(\\Gamma,A=\\Gamma\\uplus\\mathbf 1_A\\)</span>。相继式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-规则关系\">5. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}})^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}})^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个规则族均是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的子集。定义初始相继式集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash A,A^\\perp:A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{top}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash A,A^\\perp:A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{top}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ax}}=\\{(();\\vdash A,A^\\perp):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ax}}=\\{(();\\vdash A,A^\\perp):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,A^\\perp));\\vdash\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,A^\\perp));\\vdash\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\with}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Gamma,B));\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{with}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\with}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Gamma,B));\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{with}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A_i));\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{plus}(A_0,A_1)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},A_0,A_1\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A_i));\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{plus}(A_0,A_1)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},A_0,A_1\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\top}\n=\n\\{(();\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{top}):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{0}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\top}\n=\n\\{(();\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{top}):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{0}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ax}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\with}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\top}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ax}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\with}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\top}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明树\">6. 证明树</h1>\n<p>定义有限有根树为三元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(T,r,\\prec)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in T\">\\(r\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\subseteq T\\times T\">\\(\\prec\\subseteq T\\times T\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\ne r\">\\(u\\ne r\\)</span> 有唯一父节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\prec v\">\\(u\\prec v\\)</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1}\">\\(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1}\\)</span> 为节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的直接子节点列。</p>\n<p>ALL 证明树是四元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\ell)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(T,r,\\prec,\\ell)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\">\\(\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\)</span>，并且每个节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in T\">\\(u\\in T\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"初始叶节点\">初始叶节点</h3>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 没有直接子节点，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h3 id=\"规则节点\">规则节点</h3>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的直接子节点列为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1}\">\\(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl((\\ell(u_0),\\ldots,\\ell(u_{n-1})),\\ell(u)\\bigr)\n\\in\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl((\\ell(u_0),\\ldots,\\ell(u_{n-1})),\\ell(u)\\bigr)\n\\in\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\ell)\\text{ 是 ALL 证明树且根标号为 }\\vdash\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\ell)\\text{ 是 ALL 证明树且根标号为 }\\vdash\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可导关系\">7. 可导关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\Gamma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\Gamma)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\Gamma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\Gamma)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义可导相继式集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}:\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}:\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义以相继式为参数的证明对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(Q)\n=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\ell)\\text{ 是 ALL 证明树且根标号为 }Q\\},\n\\qquad Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(Q)\n=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\ell)\\text{ 是 ALL 证明树且根标号为 }Q\\},\n\\qquad Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义句法结构载体：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\">\\(Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\)</span>，定义句法满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{\\mathsf{ALL}}Q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nQ\\in X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\models_{\\mathsf{ALL}}Q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nQ\\in X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义闭包谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(X)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\subseteq X\n\\ \\wedge\\\n\\forall \\Pi\\in(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}})^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n\\bigl((\\Pi,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\wedge\\operatorname{ran}(\\Pi)\\subseteq X\\Rightarrow Q\\in X\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(X)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\subseteq X\n\\ \\wedge\\\n\\forall \\Pi\\in(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}})^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n\\bigl((\\Pi,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\wedge\\operatorname{ran}(\\Pi)\\subseteq X\\Rightarrow Q\\in X\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义句法后承：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALL}}Q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(X)\\Rightarrow X\\models_{\\mathsf{ALL}}Q\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALL}}Q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(X)\\Rightarrow X\\models_{\\mathsf{ALL}}Q\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-目标差异\">8. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>ALL 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{with},\\operatorname{plus}\\},\n(-)^\\perp,\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{with},\\operatorname{plus}\\},\n(-)^\\perp,\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该对象记录 ALL 只含加法单位、加法连接词和文字对偶；不含乘法构造子、上下文分裂、指数、弱化或收缩。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{At},\n\\mathsf{Lit},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n(-)^\\perp,\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\operatorname{freshAt}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{At},\n\\mathsf{Lit},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n(-)^\\perp,\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\operatorname{freshAt}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含加法线性逻辑句法、相继式规则、证明树、句法满足、闭包后承和可导关系；不含乘法、指数或外延语义模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与对偶","text":"2. 公式与对偶","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由原子、替换与-α-等价","text":"3. 自由原子、替换与 α 等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-上下文与相继式","text":"4. 上下文与相继式","level":1},{"id":"5.-规则关系","text":"5. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明树","text":"6. 证明树","level":1},{"id":"初始叶节点","text":"初始叶节点","level":3},{"id":"规则节点","text":"规则节点","level":3},{"id":"7.-可导关系","text":"7. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标差异","text":"8. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Lit}=\\{p^+:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\}\\cup\\{p^-:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\partial(p^+)=p^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial(p^-)=p^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lit},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{with},\\operatorname{plus}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lit}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{with},\\operatorname{plus}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lit}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{with}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lit}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{lit}(\\partial(a)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{top}^\\perp=\\operatorname{zero},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{zero}^\\perp=\\operatorname{top},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{with}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{plus}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{with}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{base}(p^+)=p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{base}(p^-)=p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{lit}(a))=\\{\\operatorname{base}(a)\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{top})\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{zero})\n=\n\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{with}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(\\operatorname{plus}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(p^+)=\\sigma(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(p^-)=\\sigma(p)^\\perp","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lit}(a)[\\sigma]=\\widehat\\sigma(a),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{top}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{top},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{zero}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{zero},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{with}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{with}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{plus}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(A)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{freshAt}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(X)=p_m,\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:p_i\\notin X\\},","display":true},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{ALL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{lit}(\\rho(p)^+).","display":true